from "react" import useRef, useState, useEffect, useId
from "../utils/strokeEngine.hys" import split_indexed_chars, measure_bbox, is_box_equal, animate_stroke, prime_stroke
from "../utils/revealEngine" import on_visible_once

component StrokeText(text="Reyhan Akhtar Afriansyah", strokeColor="#cc785c", fillColor="#26251e", strokeWidth=1.5, drawDuration=1.5, fillDelay=0.15, stagger=0.04, ease="power2.out", fillMode="wipe", fontSize=72, fontWeight=500, letterSpacing=-2, animate_on_enter=False, className="", style={}):
    root_ref = useRef(None)
    stroke_text_ref = useRef(None)
    wipe_rect_ref = useRef(None)
    has_animated_ref = useRef(False)
    box, set_box = useState(None)

    raw_id = useId()
    clean_id = raw_id.replace(":", "").replace("-", "")
    wipe_id = f"stroke-wipe-{clean_id}"
    characters = split_indexed_chars(text)
    dash = 500

    def measure_effect():
        def do_measure():
            node = stroke_text_ref.current
            if node:
                bbox = measure_bbox(node, strokeWidth, fontSize)
                if bbox and not is_box_equal(box, bbox):
                    set_box(bbox)

        do_measure()

        if document.fonts and document.fonts.ready:
            document.fonts.ready.then(do_measure)

        if document.fonts:
            document.fonts.addEventListener("loadingdone", do_measure)

        def cleanup():
            if document.fonts:
                document.fonts.removeEventListener("loadingdone", do_measure)

        return cleanup

    useEffect(measure_effect, [text, fontSize, strokeWidth])

    def run_once(root):
        if has_animated_ref.current:
            return None
        Object.assign(has_animated_ref, {"current": True})
        return animate_stroke(root, wipe_rect_ref.current, box["width"], dash, drawDuration, fillDelay, stagger, ease, fillMode, len(characters))

    def prime_effect():
        # Siapkan keadaan "belum digambar" sejak mount. Kalau tidak, judul akan
        # sempat terlihat penuh sesaat sebelum coretannya dimulai.
        root = root_ref.current
        if root and animate_on_enter and not has_animated_ref.current:
            prime_stroke(root, None, dash, fillMode)
        return lambda: None

    useEffect(prime_effect, [])

    def anim_effect():
        root = root_ref.current
        if not root or not box:
            return lambda: None

        # Animasi dijalankan SEKALI saja; tidak pernah diulang saat scroll,
        # resize, maupun render ulang.
        if has_animated_ref.current:
            return lambda: None

        if not animate_on_enter:
            run_once(root)
            return lambda: None

        # Mode tunda: tunggu elemen benar-benar masuk viewport baru digambar.
        if not ("IntersectionObserver" in window):
            run_once(root)
            return lambda: None

        query = window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)")
        reduced = query.matches if query else False
        if reduced:
            # Tanpa animasi: tampilkan langsung dalam keadaan jadi.
            Object.assign(has_animated_ref, {"current": True})
            if wipe_rect_ref.current:
                wipe_rect_ref.current.setAttribute("width", f"{box['width']}")
            for node in root.querySelectorAll("[data-stroke-char]"):
                Object.assign(node.style, {"strokeDasharray": "none", "strokeDashoffset": "0"})
            return lambda: None

        # on_visible_once ada di utils/revealEngine.ts karena compiler .hyx
        # memanggil konstruktor DOM tanpa `new`.
        return on_visible_once(root, lambda: run_once(root), 0.2, 200)

    useEffect(anim_effect, [box])

    # Safe fallback width: 24 chars at fontSize 72 in Inter is ~907px. 960 gives safe headroom so 'h' never overflows.
    safe_fallback_w = Math.max(960, fontSize * len(characters) * 0.58)
    view_box = f"{box['x']} {box['y']} {box['width']} {box['height']}" if box else f"0 {-fontSize} {safe_fallback_w} {fontSize * 1.3}"

    span(
        ref=root_ref,
        className=f"block w-full leading-[0] {className}",
        style=style,
        role="img",
        aria_label=text,
    ):
        svg(
            className="block w-full overflow-visible",
            style={"height": "auto", "maxHeight": "110px"},
            viewBox=view_box,
            preserveAspectRatio="xMinYMid meet",
            aria_hidden=True,
        ):
            if fillMode == "wipe" and box:
                defs():
                    clipPath(id=wipe_id, clipPathUnits="userSpaceOnUse"):
                        rect(ref=wipe_rect_ref, x=box["x"], y=box["y"], width=0, height=box["height"])

            text(
                ref=stroke_text_ref,
                className="select-none font-sans",
                x=0,
                y=0,
                fill="none",
                stroke=strokeColor,
                strokeWidth=strokeWidth,
                strokeLinejoin="round",
                strokeLinecap="round",
                style={"fontSize": f"{fontSize}px", "fontWeight": fontWeight, "letterSpacing": f"{letterSpacing}px"},
            ):
                for item in characters:
                    tspan(data_stroke_char=True, key=f"s-{item['key']}"):
                        item["char"]

            text(
                className="select-none font-sans fill-ink",
                x=0,
                y=0,
                fill=fillColor,
                stroke="none",
                style={"fontSize": f"{fontSize}px", "fontWeight": fontWeight, "letterSpacing": f"{letterSpacing}px"},
                clipPath=f"url(#{wipe_id})" if fillMode == "wipe" and box else None,
            ):
                for item in characters:
                    tspan(data_fill_char=True, key=f"f-{item['key']}"):
                        item["char"]
